        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"9d107cfb-3c1e-4bf1-b8c7-6db7fa246ace\",\"review_text\":\"Idk why they r just forcing us to buy their premium and ruin the experience of free users\"},{\"review_id\":\"2b06b1fe-122a-412e-baee-1ec3b4fd42a7\",\"review_text\":\"Good\"},{\"review_id\":\"a24e2190-0ee9-40a5-a9a8-8a66f45fd903\",\"review_text\":\"I love all the song that have in this app\"},{\"review_id\":\"9f52c0c3-d1ed-4a64-b589-d182db7d9e63\",\"review_text\":\"Great app with all my favourite music\"},{\"review_id\":\"613715a3-c3b5-463a-9b05-68c70e12cf67\",\"review_text\":\"I hit this app and this country\"},{\"review_id\":\"47ab8a7e-e9da-45ef-bcfd-036fff3896a3\",\"review_text\":\"Spotify was good app until I ran into a problem I couldn't play the songs I wanted to listen to I was forced to use shuffle and I couldn't listen to the music I wanted unless I had premium. Spatify was good but it wouldn't let me listen to the music I wanted so now I have to use YouTube music\"},{\"review_id\":\"e5bba4d2-de8c-4def-bccf-b0d77c5e6c3f\",\"review_text\":\"Very good app,\"},{\"review_id\":\"b8b31529-9476-4a5f-8c66-cea9626f9a21\",\"review_text\":\"The app on my new watch 5 doesn't work properly. It won't switch between my watch and my phone. It just searches for available Bluetooth connections (when my phone is connected), and won't show any Bluetooth connections, therefore I cannot switch.\"},{\"review_id\":\"2de95e35-0f68-4110-8586-76a6c0949460\",\"review_text\":\"Ok\"},{\"review_id\":\"7ad23e9a-54de-4930-a541-ed50076f362e\",\"review_text\":\"Don't like the abs😥 but it has been a great app😆\"}]}"
